        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 6.2MW, onshore, tower</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 6.2MW, onshore, tower
UUID=6f737726-046e-368f-a76a-49e67447c110
Wind turbine tower, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Vestas V162-6.2MW onshore wind turbine (Mali &amp; Garrett, 2023).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f737726-046e-368f-a76a-49e67447c110.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
